{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And he set</b> — as Pharaoh called Joseph's name Zaphenath-paneach. And Rav Saadia said: <i>Bel</i> is a Chaldean expression, and likewise <i>Tsar</i>, and similarly Nevuchadnetzar, Belshatzar [who is] Sheshbazzar, and <i>Bel</i> is explicitly [a divine name], like Elohim. And Shadrach, Meshach — they are Chaldean. And the Gaon [Saadia] said that <i>Nego</i> is like <i>Navo</i>, but without proof."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:47.497227004Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}